@anon.863986d00e4103fb69f29fe2b65b0919.807 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [576 x i8] }> <{ [576 x i8] c"The position at which the line is placed, given its column (`x`) -\0Aeither `{start}` to draw before it or `{end}` to draw after it.\0A\0AThe values `{left}` and `{right}` are also accepted, but discouraged as\0Athey cause your table to be inconsistent between left-to-right and\0Aright-to-left documents.\0A\0AThis setting is only relevant when column gutter is enabled (and\0Ashouldn't be used otherwise - prefer just increasing the `x` field by\0Aone instead), since then the position after a column becomes different\0Afrom the position before the next column due to the spacing between\0Aboth." }>, align 1
